like a jagged knife.

217
00:23:03,080 --> 00:23:05,000
<i>So I sent her back</i>
<i>to the desert,</i>

218
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:06,640
<i>where she belonged.</i>

219
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:08,880
<i>Some people thought</i>
<i>I was foolish,</i>

220
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:11,120
<i>but I knew it was right.</i>

221
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:13,840
