anymore.

222
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,360
So be it.

223
00:23:15,440 --> 00:23:17,800
At least we have
a roof overhead.

224
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:20,760
That's luckier than most.

225
00:23:20,840 --> 00:23:22,960
